{"id":"n15592-1-7","stage":5,"title":"속삭이다 · 窃窃私语","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15592-1-7-1","ko":"회의 중에 비서가 사장님에게 뭐라고 속삭인 거죠?","zh":"开会的时候秘书对老板低声说了什么吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회의","meaning":"会，会议","explanation":"회의：会，会议","readings":[{"term":"회의","audio":"/audio/8ada2d6d6aa420fc4f0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73244","senseId":"1","lemma":"회의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"중에","meaning":"的时候","explanation":"중：的时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"2","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비서가","meaning":"秘书","explanation":"비서：秘书；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비서","audio":"/audio/85835297bf18c886a12b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60650","senseId":"1","lemma":"비서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사장님에게","meaning":"老板，总经理","explanation":"사장：老板，总经理；님：尊称后缀。；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"사장","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61274","senseId":"1","lemma":"사장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐라고","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"속삭인","meaning":"窃窃私语，咬耳朵","explanation":"속삭이다：窃窃私语，咬耳朵；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"속삭이다","audio":"/audio/946443401685319e9009.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15592","senseId":"1","lemma":"속삭이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거죠?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8ada2d6d6aa420fc","term":"회의","zh":"会，会议","audio":"/audio/8ada2d6d6aa420fc4f0d.mp3","entryId":"73244","definition":"许多人聚在一起讨论；或指这种聚会。","pronunciation":["회ː의","훼ː이"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"的时候","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"在做某事的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"85835297bf18c886","term":"비서","zh":"秘书","audio":"/audio/85835297bf18c886a12b.mp3","entryId":"60650","definition":"安排一部分要职人士的事务或日程等的人。","pronunciation":["비ː서"]},{"id":"ede38c8825edb7fb","term":"사장","zh":"老板，总经理","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3","entryId":"61274","definition":"代表公司对公司事务负责的人。","pronunciation":["사장"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"946443401685319e","term":"속삭이다","zh":"窃窃私语，咬耳朵","audio":"/audio/946443401685319e9009.mp3","entryId":"15592","definition":"不停地低声说悄悄话，不让别人听到。","pronunciation":["속싸기다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/4dfa9100309d7b12fbc7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15592-1-7-2","ko":"아마 급한 연락이 왔다고 한 것 같습니다.","zh":"大概是说有紧急消息传来了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아마","meaning":"也许","explanation":"아마：也许","readings":[{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71248","senseId":"1","lemma":"아마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"급한","meaning":"急","explanation":"급하다：急；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"급하다","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86862","senseId":"1","lemma":"급하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연락이","meaning":"联络，联系","explanation":"연락：联络，联系；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14013","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔다고","meaning":"来，传来","explanation":"오다：来，传来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"6","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"表示引用。","explanation":"하다：表示引用。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같습니다.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2a38de25ef5f5194","term":"아마","zh":"也许","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3","entryId":"71248","definition":"虽然不能说得很明确，猜测或估计很有可能地。","pronunciation":["아마"]},{"id":"5c52cd24e00b6dba","term":"급하다","zh":"急","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3","entryId":"86862","definition":"处境或情况处于需要赶紧处理的状态。","pronunciation":["그파다"]},{"id":"b1c3b94a6a87c1f5","term":"연락","zh":"联络，联系","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3","entryId":"14013","definition":"传达告知某个事实。","pronunciation":["열락"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，传来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"消息或联系等被转达给某人。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。"